@startuml Kafka 请求处理流程简化图

!define LIGHTBLUE #E1F5FE
!define LIGHTGREEN #E8F5E8
!define LIGHTYELLOW #FFF9C4
!define LIGHTPINK #FCE4EC

title Kafka 请求处理流程

skinparam componentStyle rectangle
skinparam backgroundColor white

' 定义组件
[Client] as Client LIGHTBLUE
[Acceptor] as Acceptor LIGHTGREEN
[Processor] as Processor LIGHTGREEN
[RequestChannel] as Channel LIGHTYELLOW
[Handler] as Handler LIGHTPINK

' 定义队列
queue RequestQueue as ReqQ
queue ResponseQueue as RespQ

' 连接关系
Client -right-> Acceptor : TCP 连接
Acceptor -right-> Processor : 分发连接
Processor -down-> ReqQ : 请求入队
ReqQ -right-> Channel : 缓冲请求
Channel -right-> Handler : 取出请求
Handler -down-> RespQ : 响应入队
RespQ -left-> Processor : 取出响应
Processor -up-> Client : 发送响应

' 标注
note top of Acceptor : 接受连接
note top of Processor : 网络 I/O
note right of Channel : 请求-响应\n缓冲通道
note top of Handler : 业务处理

' 流程说明
note bottom
  **核心流程：**
  1. Client 建立 TCP 连接到 Acceptor
  2. Acceptor 将连接分发给 Processor
  3. Processor 接收请求并放入 RequestQueue
  4. Handler 从 RequestQueue 取出请求处理
  5. Handler 将响应放入 ResponseQueue
  6. Processor 从 ResponseQueue 取出响应
  7. Processor 将响应发送给 Client
end note

@enduml
